WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.683 --> 00:00:16.544
travelers laid the soaked scrolls on some rocks.

2
00:00:18.686 --> 00:00:20.927
"The sun will dry them out," said Wukong.

3
00:00:22.208 --> 00:00:23.568
The Tang Monk moaned.

4
00:00:23.588 --> 00:00:25.670
"What if they're ruined?"

5
00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:29.572
He sat down and put his head in his hands.

6
00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:34.043
"I wish I'd remembered to ask Buddha the turtle's question!"

7
00:00:35.484 --> 00:00:36.485
Bajie snorted.

8
00:00:36.505 --> 00:00:40.268
"Who cares if you forgot the turtle's question?

9
00:00:40.949 --> 00:00:43.531
That turtle had no right to dump us in the water!"

10
00:00:45.173 --> 00:00:48.235
"Dumping us in the water was rude," Wujing agreed.

11
00:00:49.156 --> 00:00:50.217
Bajie sighed.

12
00:00:50.778 --> 00:00:55.301
"The journey back east is becoming just as difficult as the journey west."

13
00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:58.004
"Hello!" cried a voice.

14
00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:01.893
The travelers turned and saw a man hurrying toward them.

15
00:01:01.913 --> 00:01:05.274
"Chen," said the Tang Monk.

16
00:01:06.214 --> 00:01:07.915
He grasped the man's hands.

17
00:01:07.935 --> 00:01:09.995
"It's good to see you again."

18
00:01:10.015 --> 00:01:12.716
"It's good to see all of you."

19
00:01:13.036 --> 00:01:13.856
Chen smiled.

20
00:01:13.876 --> 00:01:16.517
"Did you reach the Western Paradise?"

21
00:01:17.857 --> 00:01:19.418
"Yes," said the Tang Monk.

22
00:01:19.438 --> 00:01:21.178
"It was magnificent!

23
00:01:21.998 --> 00:01:23.779
The land is filled with beauty."

24
00:01:24.919 --> 00:01:29.421
Chen noticed the scrolls lying on the rocks, and his eyes went wide.

25
00:01:29.441 --> 00:01:32.642
"Are those the True Scriptures?"

26
00:01:33.102 --> 00:01:33.702
he whispered.

27
00:01:33.722 --> 00:01:36.524
"Yes," said the monk.

28
00:01:36.544 --> 00:01:39.145
"But as you can see, they got wet."

29
00:01:41.526 --> 00:01:46.388
"A giant turtle dumped us in the river," added Bajie with a sigh.

30
00:01:46.408 --> 00:01:49.749
"Please come with me," said Chen.

31
00:01:49.769 --> 00:01:52.710
"You can dry the True Scriptures by my fire.

32
00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:57.272
Everyone in the village will be excited to see the travelers who met Buddha."

33
00:01:58.272 --> 00:02:00.653
Wujing started gathering the wet scriptures.

34
00:02:02.354 --> 00:02:03.995
"I'll help you," said Bajie.

35
00:02:05.256 --> 00:02:07.217
The pig grabbed a scroll and pulled.

36
00:02:08.558 --> 00:02:10.018
But it was stuck to a rock.

37
00:02:11.559 --> 00:02:14.841
Rip! The corner of the scroll tore off.

38
00:02:18.463 --> 00:02:19.904
The Tang Monk gasped.

39
00:02:20.424 --> 00:02:20.924
"Oh no!"

40
00:02:22.405 --> 00:02:25.547
Bajie stared in horror at the torn scroll.

41
00:02:26.827 --> 00:02:27.968
Wukong smiled.

42
00:02:28.428 --> 00:02:30.008
"Don't worry, Master."

43
00:02:31.229 --> 00:02:34.550
The monkey gently picked the rest of the scroll off the rock.

44
00:02:34.570 --> 00:02:36.470
"The scroll is fine."

45
00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:38.591
"But it's ripped!"

46
00:02:38.931 --> 00:02:39.611
cried the monk.

47
00:02:40.651 --> 00:02:41.812
Bajie hung his head.

48
00:02:41.832 --> 00:02:46.253
"Tell me something, Master," said Wukong.

49
00:02:46.273 --> 00:02:47.993
"Are you perfect?"

50
00:02:49.334 --> 00:02:51.974
The monk gave Wukong a confused look.

51
00:02:51.994 --> 00:02:54.955
"Of course not."

52
00:02:54.975 --> 00:02:56.216
"Am I perfect?"

53
00:02:56.536 --> 00:02:57.236
asked the monkey.

54
00:02:58.304 --> 00:02:59.986
The Tang Monk shook his head.

55
00:03:00.006 --> 00:03:03.548
"How about Bajie?"

56
00:03:04.469 --> 00:03:05.470
Wukong smirked.

57
00:03:06.351 --> 00:03:08.632
"We all know he's not perfect."

58
00:03:09.934 --> 00:03:11.575
The pig snorted.

59
00:03:11.595 --> 00:03:15.618
"Nothing on Earth or in Heaven is perfect," said Wukong.

60
00:03:15.638 --> 00:03:18.881
"So why should the True Scriptures be any different?

61
00:03:20.162 --> 00:03:23.484
They'll teach the people of the East how to be good and avoid suffering.

62
00:03:24.345 --> 00:03:27.528
They will also teach the people that nothing needs to be perfect."

63
00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:36.663
The travelers finished gathering the scrolls and followed Chen back to the village.

64
00:03:40.765 --> 00:03:43.607
People came out of their homes to see the travelers.

65
00:03:43.627 --> 00:03:45.929
"Welcome back!"

66
00:03:46.229 --> 00:03:46.910
called a woman.

67
00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:49.691
"It's wonderful to see you all again!"

68
00:03:49.992 --> 00:03:51.092
shouted an old man.

69
00:03:52.293 --> 00:03:56.456
Soon a crowd was following the Tang Monk and his companions to Chen's house.

70
00:03:59.638 --> 00:04:02.160
That evening the villagers held a big feast.

71
00:04:03.956 --> 00:04:07.577
Later that night Wukong and the Tang Monk sat, talking.

72
00:04:07.597 --> 00:04:10.658
"We must leave soon," said the monk.

73
00:04:10.678 --> 00:04:13.859
"The villagers will want to see the True Scriptures.

74
00:04:14.839 --> 00:04:16.500
They'll become jealous that we have them."

75
00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:19.761
"I agree," said Wukong.

76
00:04:20.901 --> 00:04:24.983
He remembered the priest who'd tried to kill the Tang Monk and steal the robe.

77
00:04:25.003 --> 00:04:29.544
"Let's sneak away now, while the villagers are asleep," said Wukong.

78
00:04:31.072 --> 00:04:34.134
The monk and the monkey woke up Bajie and Wujing.

79
00:04:35.415 --> 00:04:38.376
The group sneaked out of Chen's house and headed east.

80
00:04:39.777 --> 00:04:43.759
It was dark, but the light from the full moon lit up the road.

81
00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:48.442
Suddenly the guard from the Thunderclap Monastery appeared.

82
00:04:48.462 --> 00:04:51.804
"Congratulations!" said the guard.

83
00:04:51.824 --> 00:04:55.406
"You have faced one hundred challenges."

84
00:04:55.426 --> 00:04:59.068
"Whew." The monk sighed with relief.

85
00:05:00.596 --> 00:05:02.160
"I will become a buddha at last."

86
00:05:03.622 --> 00:05:05.226
The guard recited a spell.

87
00:05:06.789 --> 00:05:09.815
Once again the travelers flew toward the East.
